# WEFT VCA and ENV: INIT's saw and low pass, its SLOPE an ENV and its MULT a VCA (CV: the ENV): silent before the
# note, up while it is held, gone soon after it lets go (ENV releases at once, it doesn't finish a rise first)
wait 300
settp 1 KIND 6
wait 50
wpreset 1 0
wset 1 0 2 73
wset 1 0 4 72
wset 1 7 7 0
wset 1 7 8 0
wset 1 7 4 30
wait 200
expect wtype 1 2 73
expect wtype 1 4 72
expect meter_max 1 0.001
key 7 down
wait 400
expect meter_min 1 0.01
key 7 up
wait 1500
expect meter_max 1 0.002
